{"type": "message", "message": "The idea was **coziness through texture, warmth and softer light—not more furniture**.\n\n- Oatmeal upholstery and a soft rug would make the seating group feel inviting and visually connected.\n- Warm wood and muted terracotta or olive would add colour without making the room feel busy.\n- A shaded floor lamp would provide gentler evening light.\n\nI kept the earlier sofa-and-chair concept, with the aim of leaving room for dining and balcony access. **I haven’t specified exact furniture positions or applied a layout**—the latest suggestion was a styling direction, not a checked arrangement.", "conversationId": "12816ee8aaa340cf9cb3f4f77d91362e"}
